Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 01:23:56 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add the wash room the wash screen draws round the tub (#856)

CleanACat_Area_WashRoom: a 26 stud square pastel bathroom, 12 high, every face turned inward, sized to
WashScreenRules (HALF 13, HEIGHT 12, FLOOR_LIFT 0.05). Pivot at the tub's spot, front -Z toward the wash
camera. Tiled floor and walls, a round window, shelf, towels and bubbles on the back wall, a towel rail and
mirror on the sides, plants, a bath mat and a ceiling lamp. 4188 tris, 163 parts.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DW2up1ahn23P9Rf5xanBXQ
